        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLW1RDDFBR, Offset Elegant Reed Front Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Offset Elegant Reed Door Pull is available in 18 inch or 24 inch lengths. Made by First Impressions, these front door handles are part of the Delaware Collection that features traditional designs that are beautifully styled. They can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from a wide array of finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW02-specifications.gif?v=1704354661\" width=\"505\" height=\"234\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions DLDLW1RDDFBR02 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions DLW1RDDFBR Delaware Offset Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262217\"><b>First Impressions DLW1RDDFBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>DLW1018RDDFBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.39\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DLW1024RDDFBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 21-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.39\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
